OL,3,ATrump threatens new tariffs on Canadian
OL,4,Avehicles after trade talks collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoth countries were optimistic of a
OL,7,Fdeal last week, but talks fell apart
OL,8,Fafter each accused the other of making
OL,9,Flast-minute changes
OL,11,F"They asked too much and they offered
OL,12,Ftoo little," Carney said on Saturday
OL,14,FChief US trade negotiator Jamieson
OL,15,FGreer downplayed the significance of
OL,16,Fthe failed talks, calling it a "tempest
OL,17,Fin a teapot"
OL,19,FCarney is expected to speak at 1230 EST
OL,20,Ftoday
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
